  "ALL_TEXT": "56 EXT. ROAD - NIGHT \nThe BUM is walking unsteadily, casually looking around when a \n1000 rupee note from an ATM centre near him flies out due to \na breeze. It was previously stuck in a crevice. The \nfluttering of the paper attracts his attention. He runs after \nit in a daze. In his eagerness to get to the note, he runs \ninto GOVARDHAN, who is carrying his tiffin box and Milton \nwater flask. The bump causes his spectacles to fall off. In \nturn, GOVARDHAN gets in the way of a VEDA, who is driving his \nbike slowly, enjoying a cigarette. In order to avoid hitting \nGOVARDHAN, he breaks. VEDA cannot avoid crashing into a car \nthough, which is parked in the side. The tail lamp of the car \nbreaks. Fuel starts to drip out of the car. VASU steps out \nfrom the car. \nVASU \nNadipetappudu kallu kanapethledu? \ndhigu mundhu. \nThe PUG barks at VASU. RAJU comes out from the car. VEDA gets \nmad when VASU pushes VEDA. \nVEDA \nRey chal ra bhai chal. Naatakalu \ndhobbaka pani chusuko. \nVASU \nEvadura naatakalu dhobbe dhi? \nSaaley \nRAJU \nNuvu urukoraa...edini neenu \nchusukunta \nRAJU grabs a hold of VEDA\u2019s collar; VEDA punches him in the \nface. RAJU collapses on the floor, still conscious. VASU gets \ninto his car for a bit, and walks rapidly back to VEDA, now \npointing a pistol at him. VEDA's stance changes... \nVEDA \nVaadevado addochaadu... \nkanpeeledaa... Nenencheyanu... mee \nmistake kuda kaadhu..parvaledhu \nmeeru velandi \nVASU \nEm mazaakulaaduthunnava? \nVASU hits VEDA. That pisses VEDA off and he just looses it. \nGOVARDHAN, who has been searching for his spectacles, finds \nthem on the road. GOVARDHAN puts his tiffin box down and is \nabout to pick his glasses up when VEDA comes charging in to \npick up the tiffin box. In the process, he inadvertently \nkicks GOVARDHAN\u2019s spectacles. VEDA flicks the cigarette butt \nhe was holding, and swings the tiffin box at VASU, who is hit \non the head and collapses. RAJU is taken aback. Before he has \nthe time to respond, VEDA swings the tiffin box once again, \nbut this time comes to his senses before the box hits RAJU. \nHe manages to divert it, but it hits the car's window, \nbreaking it. VEDA runs to his bike. VASU is a little dazed. \nAs VEDA starts his bike, he hears some yelling from behind. \nVEDA turns to see that it is GOVARDHAN. \nGOVARDHAN \nTiffin box!... Tiffin box!! \nVEDA realizes he is still carrying the tiffin box. He throws \nit at GOVARDHAN and gets on the bike. RAJU chases after VEDA, \nbut VEDA manages to escape. VASU rises, and is angry; he sees \nGOVARDHAN with the tiffin box and gets on his case. VEDA \nnotices this in his rear-view mirror and comes back in time \nto rescue GOVARDHAN from the goons kicking him down. \nVEDA \nBandekkandi!!! \nGOVARDHAN gets on the bike and they speed away. The cigarette \nbutt thrown rolls close to the leaking fuel from the car. \nCUT TO:",
